# Cache
**/.prettiercache
**/.eslintcache
**/.vercel
# `.cache/` holds tsbuildinfo and, once the video tooling has run, the ffmpeg
# and browser downloads it fetches - tens of gigabytes on a developer machine.
# Both are gitignored, but `docker-compose.yml` builds with `context: .`, so
# without this they are uploaded to the daemon on every build.
**/.cache

